<figure class="flow">
  <ol>
    <li class="node">
      <span class="node-name">Plugin</span>
      <span class="node-note">Afgeschermd venster. Ziet nooit je token.</span>
    </li>
    <li class="link" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="link-label">vraagt data</span>
      <span class="wire"><span class="packet"></span></span>
    </li>
    <li class="node host">
      <span class="node-name">Cyfers</span>
      <span class="node-note">Op jouw computer. Sessie versleuteld, toegestane paden gecontroleerd.</span>
    </li>
    <li class="link" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="link-label">met jouw sessie</span>
      <span class="wire"><span class="packet late"></span></span>
    </li>
    <li class="node">
      <span class="node-name">Somtoday</span>
      <span class="node-note">Alleen de paden die de plugin vooraf noemt.</span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption class="visually-hidden">
    Een plugin vraagt data aan Cyfers. Cyfers controleert het pad en haalt de data op bij Somtoday met jouw sessie. De
    plugin krijgt alleen het antwoord, nooit je token.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .flow {
    margin: 0;
  }

  ol {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr minmax(4rem, 0.7fr) 1.15fr minmax(4rem, 0.7fr) 1fr;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .node {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--navy);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .node-name {
    font: 700 1.35rem/1 var(--font-display);
    color: var(--navy);
  }

  .node-note {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .host {
    background: var(--navy);
    border-color: var(--navy);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -30px rgba(13, 27, 45, 0.6);
  }

  .host .node-name {
    color: var(--on-navy);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
  }

  .host .node-note {
    color: var(--on-navy-muted);
  }

  .link {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    justify-items: center;
    padding-inline: 0.4rem;
  }

  .link-label {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .wire {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 2px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--navy) 0 6px, transparent 6px 11px);
  }

  .packet {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 0;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    margin-top: -5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    animation: packet 3.2s var(--ease) infinite;
  }

  .packet.late {
    animation-delay: 1.1s;
  }

  @keyframes packet {
    0% {
      left: 0;
      opacity: 0;
    }
    15% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    70% {
      left: calc(100% - 10px);
      opacity: 1;
    }
    85%,
    100% {
      left: calc(100% - 10px);
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    ol {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      justify-items: stretch;
    }

    .link {
      grid-template-columns: 2px auto;
      justify-content: start;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 2rem;
      height: 4.5rem;
    }

    .link-label {
      order: 2;
    }

    .wire {
      width: 2px;
      height: 100%;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(180deg, var(--navy) 0 6px, transparent 6px 11px);
    }

    .packet {
      left: 50%;
      top: 0;
      margin: 0 0 0 -5px;
      animation-name: packet-down;
    }

    @keyframes packet-down {
      0% {
        top: 0;
        opacity: 0;
      }
      15% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      70% {
        top: calc(100% - 10px);
        opacity: 1;
      }
      85%,
      100% {
        top: calc(100% - 10px);
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
